{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-29","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"Any prime number is prime to any number which it does not measure.","book":7,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","contentId":"euclid-7-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea4dfbd3ffa07985870d7e8aec22c685ca5f9e31525527bb18b48efa5fc16b48","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-29.statement","euclid-7-29.construction.1","euclid-7-29.proof.1","euclid-7-29.construction.2","euclid-7-29.proof.2","euclid-7-29.proof.3","euclid-7-29.proof.4","euclid-7-29.conclusion","euclid-7-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbebb369d9ab33bea1772376f6496cd98dae8f0727dc733348b1fad2d260ac17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Any prime number is prime to any number which it does not measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"素数是任何数字的正数,但并不为整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f92f79477e0edcc5995c001e97bc32a9a71abaf40161877fc1dcc97f9ae4341","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be a prime number, and let it not measure B; I say that B, A are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A成为素数,不要整除 B;我说B,A是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"502ce15214396fb6ca942577d62510b8268cd12fde90ccf905f7010311e43ad2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if B, A are not prime to one another, some number will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果B,A不是互素, 某些数字将达到整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca9a89520f6a579a01d8d736babf3b473c1b35d3a53f5a2bcbbf2f5a13988742","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let C measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们C、整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c86bbdd80341db5063448a7ccfd464b932803e42baa40d10bb6b223c79affd3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since C measures B, and A does not measure B, therefore C is not the same with A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于C 整除 B和A不等于整除 B,因此C与A不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c920965bb2f34590c4d907b0cc5fbe6b5a60438f05770a58c586950e18b112a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since C measures B, A, therefore it also measures A which is prime, though it is not the same with it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,从C 整除 B,A, 也就是整除 A, 虽然它不是一回事, 但这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44b940616f0eb400f8835c7dcc387a4baab689c4222ce6df327e96fa4cd8f45e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure B, A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,没有号码整除 B,A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"788ccb45adc5a1a2df78452b6e7a11d315d14abaff5d7b1ce3b447182bae62a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-29.source","contentId":"euclid-7-29","revisionId":"euclid-7-29@raw-ea4dfbd3ffa07985","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79c5059797b4019227076f2f3fdf0c343740fc3a37