ition","title":"欧几里得引理：素数整除乘积必整除一个因子","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-12:euclid-7-29:explicit","id":"euclid-9-12","book":9,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与连比例与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-36:euclid-7-29:explicit","id":"euclid-9-36","book":9,"number":36,"kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得完全数构造","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
